WEBVTT

00:00:00.310 --> 00:00:01.270
Last time on...

00:00:01.270 --> 00:00:03.230
<i>Love Live! Sunshine!!</i>

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:05.730
In the promised land to the north,

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:09.270
Ruby and Leah decided
to perform a dark ritual.

00:00:09.270 --> 00:00:11.150
H-Hello...

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:15.610
I-I... No, I mean, we...

00:00:15.610 --> 00:00:21.200
The two continued to proceed towards
enacting the ritual using only their power.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.870
And then, on that holy night...

00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:28.000
--Will you watch the concert we're creating?
--Will you watch the concert we're creating?

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:32.130
Miss!

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:34.300
Miss Mari!

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:38.010
What do we do?
Things are getting out of hand.

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:39.470
Should we give up?

00:00:39.470 --> 00:00:45.060
No! We need to wish upon a shooting star,
or else there's no way it'll work!

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:46.440
"Planisphere" "The Northern Hemisphere"

00:00:55.490 --> 00:00:57.780
Where can we see the stars more clearly?

00:00:57.780 --> 00:00:59.450
I don't know...

00:00:59.450 --> 00:01:00.870
Over there!

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:06.120
Which direction?

00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:09.460
Let's go up here!

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:17.890
Oh, no...

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:23.020
We won't know for sure
until we check it against this!

00:01:26.020 --> 00:01:29.020
"Planisphere" "The Northern Hemisphere"

00:01:29.020 --> 00:01:30.020
"Planisphere"

00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:32.270
Rain...

00:01:32.270 --> 00:01:38.110
Oh, no... We can't make
a wish like this! We can't...

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:42.450
After we made it here...
After we came this far...

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:44.700
Don't cry.

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:49.080
See?

00:01:50.670 --> 00:01:53.130
This will do!

00:01:56.130 --> 00:01:59.510
May we be together forever.

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:15.190
<i>Let's throw our all at each other</i>
<i>and grab hold of the future!</i>

00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:25.830
<i>The sky and this ocean are both on our side</i>

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:29.790
<i>Shining and saying, "Go, do your best!"</i>

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:36.510
<i>To let our voices reach far, far away</i>

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:41.430
<i>Shall we shout our dreams louder?</i>

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:43.180
<i>(Full of hope)</i>

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:47.520
<i>Today pulls tomorrow toward itself</i>

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:56.110
<i>It's really fun to grasp the magnet</i>
<i>in my heart and run right now!</i>

00:02:56.110 --> 00:02:58.240
<i>(Let's always go together)</i>

00:02:58.240 --> 00:03:01.030
<i>What shall we do about the future?!</i>

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:08.830
<i>Everyone laughs and cries</i>
<i>as</i> <i>they</i> <i>look for the shape of their dreams</i>

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:17.250
<i>Because I'm sure the</i> <i>future</i> <i>us</i>
<i>will have the answer</i>

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:25.350
<i>Let's run with everything we have</i>
<i>and become the shining wind</i>

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:28.680
<i>We got dream</i>

00:03:30.930 --> 00:03:33.980
"#10 'Finding a Way to Shine'"

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:45.530
Ta-da!

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:48.540
"New Year's Gift" "Chika Takami"

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:48.370
Happy New Year!

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:49.910
Yes, Happy New Year.

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:51.080
HNY.

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:52.460
Happy New Year.

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:55.500
More importantly, it's New Year's, right?

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:58.170
It's New Year's! Right?

00:03:58.170 --> 00:04:00.630
New Year's...

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:03.840
It's New Year's, wink, wink, nudge, nudge!

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:06.510
Hey, where are your manners?

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:11.270
Ahem. I'll be a third-year student in
high school this year, but if I may say so...

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:12.850
I've heard that generally speaking,

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:16.730
we can still get a little
you-know-what while we're students.

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:19.230
And well... I've been low
on the round stuff recently.

00:04:19.230 --> 00:04:21.570
Oh, that! I got you covered.

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:22.820
All right!

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:25.110
Here you go.

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:26.660
Or maybe this is better?

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:28.410
Or you wanna hold a New Year's ball?

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:31.620
Seriously, enough with the jokes already!

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:33.330
--Did you really think
that you'd still get a money gift?

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:34.540
--Why is this happening to me?
--Did you really think
that you'd still get a money gift?

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:36.380
--Why is this happening to me?
--I heard that Riko-<i>chan</i> told her parents
that she didn't need it anymore.

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:38.790
--I heard that Riko-<i>chan</i> told her parents
that she didn't need it anymore.

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:42.510
--What?
--Then you're not gonna get it,
either, right, Chika?

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:45.130
Each family has its own way
of doing things, right?

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:49.510
You guys always tell me that!
Even Dad tells me that!

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:51.180
Chika-<i>chan</i>!

00:04:51.180 --> 00:04:52.850
Oh, You-<i>chan</i>'s already here.

00:04:52.850 --> 00:04:55.100
Coming!

00:04:55.100 --> 00:05:00.770
Listen. Don't think this is over, okay?!
I'm just putting it on hold for now, okay?!

00:05:00.770 --> 00:05:03.110
What makes her think
she's the boss around here?

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:05.450
Looks like they're even busy on New Year's.

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:07.700
I heard that they're
practicing for Love Live.

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:12.700
Oh, I see. It's great that
they keep at it, isn't it?

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:12.330
"Morning coffee service
starts at 8 o'clock tomorrow morning"

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:22.000
"Ura High"

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:16.830
What a huge yawn, <i>zura</i>.

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:19.920
Shut up! I had a special
New Year's live stream

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:22.090
of my gathering of little demons yesterday!

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:23.710
It's cold.

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:25.840
I wonder if Dia-<i>san</i>
and the others will be here soon...

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:29.470
Oh! Looks like they made a U-turn.

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:32.260
Thanks for waiting.

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:36.140
Happy New Year.

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:37.980
Whoa! They really came!

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:39.440
Got a problem with that?

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:42.360
And those outfits are...

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:43.940
Well then, everyone...

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:47.990
Happy New Year!

00:05:49.030 --> 00:05:50.070
Cold!

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:51.950
Where's your spirit?

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:54.700
Well, it's New Year's, so...

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:59.580
And what made you think
that you could practice in <i>kimonos</i>?!

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:05.210
You've got a nice school.
It's on top of a hill like ours, huh?

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:07.970
Yep! We can see the ocean, too.

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:10.430
Though the school
won't be around much longer.

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:11.640
--What?
--What?

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:14.260
It'll be merged
with another school this spring.

00:06:14.260 --> 00:06:18.350
So March will mark the end of this school.

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:20.270
Is that true?

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:24.150
But if you do well in Love Live
and can get students...

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:29.910
Yeah... That's how we felt
for a long time, but...

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:36.660
I didn't know...

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:42.420
But everyone at school told us
that they want us to win Love Live

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:45.380
so that our school's name
will become part of Love Live history.

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:48.630
People will know that the school idols
from Uranohoshi Girls' High School

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:54.430
won Love Live...
and that this school existed here...

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:58.390
You couldn't ask for better friends
than that! How wonderful...

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:02.980
Well then, we won't hold back.

00:07:02.980 --> 00:07:04.020
--Eek!
--<i>Zura</i>?!

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:06.150
In order for you to win Love Live,

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:10.650
we'll train you as hard as we can.
We won't hold back!

00:07:10.650 --> 00:07:12.200
--Seriously?
--Seriously.

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:14.160
--Seriously, <i>zura</i>?
--Seriously, <i>zura</i>.

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:16.790
--Are you serious?
--I said I'm serious, didn't I?!

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:19.290
What's the matter?

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:22.750
Time goes quickly when
you're with your friends, doesn't it?

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:31.180
Well, this is New Year's, so...

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:33.050
What do you mean?

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:35.470
It means that your bodies
are pretty out of shape.

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:37.010
What? Really?

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:38.060
<i>Zura</i>?

00:07:38.060 --> 00:07:40.930
You need to start by waking up your bodies.

00:07:40.930 --> 00:07:42.730
Could you dash up the hill to the school gate

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:44.900
and run around
the school building three times?

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:46.900
What?!

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:49.820
I told you earlier. We won't hold back.

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:51.900
Okay, now go!

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:53.110
Let's go, <i>zura</i>.

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:55.410
This is a good workout, isn't it?

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:03.000
Are we really gonna be able
to win the finals like this?

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:05.250
--I think you'll do fine.
--Really?!

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:06.380
I think that when you're on stage,

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:10.760
you are somehow able to
make a connection with the audience.

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:14.010
If you're able to convey the feelings
you have right now to them organically,

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:17.850
I'm sure you'll perform splendidly.

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:20.890
Okay!

00:08:20.890 --> 00:08:22.640
Where's Mari-<i>chan</i>?

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:27.560
--Hm?
--Well, it seemed like she had
a phone call from her parents.

00:08:27.560 --> 00:08:30.440
Could it be that they're
cancelling the merger, <i>zura</i>?

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:34.700
Oh-ho! We have verily decided
to keep the school!

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:37.160
Don't turn her dad into a stereotype, <i>zura</i>.

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:39.450
Guys...

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:42.250
Are you done with the phone call?

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:44.420
Become a director?

00:08:44.420 --> 00:08:49.630
Of course. They wanted me to become
the director at the new merged school.

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:53.550
You see, since many
Uranohoshi students will go there,

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:57.760
they thought that the students
would feel at ease if I were there.

00:08:57.760 --> 00:08:58.930
A director?

00:08:58.930 --> 00:09:02.600
Mari-<i>chan</i> is also the director of Uranohoshi.

00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:03.600
What?!

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:06.770
Then Mari-<i>chan</i>, you will be at
the new school with us in spring, too?

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:08.650
We can continue Aqours!

00:09:08.650 --> 00:09:11.730
Well, that sounds like she's repeating a year.

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:14.030
Don't worry. I turned it down.

00:09:14.030 --> 00:09:15.530
What?!

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:17.700
I won't become the director.

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:20.660
After graduating from this school,

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:25.160
I'll go to the college in Italy
that my dad recommends.

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:28.420
So three more months...

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:30.710
That's how long I can stay here...

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:36.090
Well then...

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:38.930
I wish you could stay here a bit longer.

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:41.510
There's another place we're stopping by, so...

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:42.560
Another place?

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:46.230
I know where! They're going to
an amusement park together!

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:47.520
You didn't have to tell them!

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:49.480
Eek!

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:53.730
Here... It's the practice plan
that my sister and I came up with.

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:55.150
Thank you.

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:56.570
Whoa! This is a lot...!

00:09:56.570 --> 00:10:00.700
You're going to win Love Live, right?
You'll need to do at least that much.

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:03.740
This event isn't just about
making a memory for you, right?

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:06.660
Win no matter what. We believe in you.

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:07.500
Okay!

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:10.080
We'll do our Rubesty!

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:11.000
What's that?

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:14.090
It's Ruby-<i>chan</i>'s killer technique, <i>zura</i>.

00:10:14.090 --> 00:10:15.920
It was a technique?!

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:24.810
Italy, huh?

00:10:24.810 --> 00:10:29.810
Yeah. I kind of thought that it might happen.

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:32.610
But when that thought turns into reality...

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:37.070
It's less than three months, huh?

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:40.450
Right after Love Live is over,
there'll be a graduation ceremony.

00:10:40.450 --> 00:10:45.490
It's not just Mari-<i>chan</i>.
Dia-<i>san</i> and Kanan-<i>chan</i> will also...

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:50.540
When spring comes, there'll be
no going home together after school,

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:54.340
or saying bye at the bus stop.

00:10:54.340 --> 00:10:57.510
No Uranohoshi school uniform
or classrooms, either...

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:05.930
What will happen to Aqours...

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:09.020
...after the third-years graduate?

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:13.110
I don't know...
I really haven't thought about it.

00:11:13.110 --> 00:11:18.150
Until Love Live is over...
Until we know the results of the finals,

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:22.490
I somehow feel that I shouldn't
think about what comes after that.

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:25.330
For everyone's sake?

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:32.170
We'll perform by putting our hearts
and souls into the Love Live finals and win.

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:36.300
We'll find the shine
that we've been seeking all this time.

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:38.670
I think it's the way to show
our gratitude to everyone at school

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:44.470
as well as Mari-<i>chan</i>, Kanan-<i>chan</i>,
and Dia-<i>san</i>, who are graduating.

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:48.680
Wh-What?

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:50.140
I agree.

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:52.230
H-Hey!

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:54.360
I couldn't agree more!

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:10.330
We haven't been
to this tunnel in a long time.

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:13.500
--This place is always relaxing.
--It is.

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:15.790
So... what's up?

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:19.590
Don't tell me that you're going to
try to stop me from going to Italy?

00:12:19.590 --> 00:12:23.260
We might have if it were a year ago.

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:26.890
Then, you're upset because I made
the decision without talking to you?

00:12:26.890 --> 00:12:28.850
That's not it, either.

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:31.980
We both had something
we wanted to tell you.

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:33.440
To tell you the truth,

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:36.560
I've been accepted by a college in Tokyo
based on a recommendation.

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:42.650
As for me, I want to go overseas
and get my diving instructor's license.

00:12:42.650 --> 00:12:43.990
Then...

00:12:43.990 --> 00:12:49.740
Yeah... After graduating,
we'll all go our separate ways.

00:12:53.540 --> 00:12:57.960
It means that no one'll remain here
and it won't be easy to see each other.

00:12:57.960 --> 00:13:01.170
We wanted to tell you that.

00:13:01.170 --> 00:13:02.840
I see.

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:07.430
To think that all of us made our decisions
without talking to each other...

00:13:07.430 --> 00:13:11.930
We had a huge fight over that,
and yet, we haven't changed...

00:13:11.930 --> 00:13:13.430
Yeah.

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:21.440
Let's... hug!

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:37.290
Come to think of it, you used to
sneak out quite often, Mari.

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:40.090
For that matter, you two were equally guilty.

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:42.920
It was because you snuck out
without telling anyone, Mari-<i>san</i>.

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:47.090
I didn't tell anyone because
they'd say "no" for sure if I told them.

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:50.390
Thanks to that, your parents
became a lot more strict.

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:53.970
Your room was moved to the second floor
so that you couldn't sneak out.

00:13:53.970 --> 00:13:55.770
Then to the third floor.

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:58.600
But it didn't work,
so up to the fourth floor you went.

00:13:58.600 --> 00:14:00.270
In the end, they moved you to the top floor.

00:14:00.270 --> 00:14:04.190
Looking back, I now understand
how much of a headache you were.

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:07.700
But they told me not to play with you two.

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:11.410
Eventually, there was
talk of disownment, right?

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:14.290
I told them, "Mom. Dad. If you tell me
not to play with Kanan and Dia,

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:16.620
I'm going to disown you two!"

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:21.840
I've never heard of an elementary school child
trying to disown their parents.

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:24.590
You were the one who taught me that, Dia.

00:14:24.590 --> 00:14:26.170
Was I?

00:14:26.170 --> 00:14:28.590
We were kids.

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:33.390
But it was fun.

00:14:33.390 --> 00:14:37.600
Something new was happening every day.

00:14:39.940 --> 00:14:43.940
I won't repeat this, so listen carefully.

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:49.610
After I came to know you two,
I learned a lot of things from you.

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:51.700
The world is a big place.

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:56.540
When you're with your friends, it's so fun
that you even forget about the time.

00:14:56.540 --> 00:15:00.830
How to fight and how to make up...

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:07.260
If you hadn't taken me outside,
I wouldn't have known any of those things.

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:11.470
I wouldn't have been able
to come out of that room.

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:12.590
Ever since that day,

00:15:12.590 --> 00:15:15.930
I've always thought that if the three of us
were together, we could do anything.

00:15:15.930 --> 00:15:21.350
And that as long as
I feel the same way, I'll be okay.

00:15:21.350 --> 00:15:23.150
Thank you!

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:27.190
Hm?

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:30.490
It's starting to rain.

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:33.070
Again? Jeez, Dia...

00:15:33.070 --> 00:15:36.490
Wait? Me? It's Mari-<i>san</i> who brings the rain.

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:38.830
Why?! It's Kanan.

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:41.040
I'll sue you.

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:50.720
It may be that God doesn't
want our wish to come true.

00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:53.510
The wish that the three of us
can be together forever?

00:15:53.510 --> 00:15:57.930
We'll disown a narrow-minded God like that.

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:03.650
Is it really okay that it ends like this?

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:04.810
What?

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:09.940
Is it really okay that we couldn't make a wish
upon a shooting star just like then?

00:16:09.940 --> 00:16:11.570
Kanan...

00:16:11.570 --> 00:16:13.820
It isn't for me.

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:16.990
You thought we could do anything
if the three of us were together, right?

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:19.410
Then we should try.

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:20.750
But...

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:24.120
Besides, it's not just the three of us anymore.

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:28.710
Let's go find a star that's just for us.

00:16:28.710 --> 00:16:32.130
A star that's just for us...

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:36.010
Neeeeeewww Year's gift!

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:34.130
"New Year's Gift"
"From your parents, Shima, and Mito + Shiitake"

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:38.470
Let's see...

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:40.270
"Go to the hot spring!"

00:16:38.470 --> 00:16:40.430
"Go to the hot spring"?

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:42.560
New Year's gift!

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:44.270
"Go to your father!"

00:16:44.350 --> 00:16:46.110
Jeez...!

00:16:46.110 --> 00:16:48.820
New Year's gift!

00:16:48.820 --> 00:16:50.440
Arrrgh!

00:16:50.440 --> 00:16:51.940
Ah, hey!

00:16:51.940 --> 00:16:53.360
Where's Mom?

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:55.410
--Tokyo.
--Already?

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:59.370
Oh, yeah. This is for you,
Chika-<i>chan</i>, from Mom.

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:01.290
"Check the ball at the front door!
The goal is in sight!"

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:02.000
The ball at the front door...?

00:17:02.790 --> 00:17:06.380
"Love Live!" "You have our full support!
From your parents, Shima, and Mito + Shiitake"

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:12.260
Thank you, guys...

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:14.510
Chika!

00:17:14.510 --> 00:17:15.840
Wanna go out a bit?

00:17:15.840 --> 00:17:19.560
Go out? It's raining.

00:17:19.560 --> 00:17:20.810
Whoa!

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:22.060
What's going on?

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:24.020
We were all asked to come.

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:28.360
Seriously, what a bother... I have a show
to stream tonight again, you know...

00:17:28.360 --> 00:17:30.650
But it's kinda fun.

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:32.900
Where are we going?

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:38.700
"Tochiman" "Restaurant"

00:17:35.610 --> 00:17:37.570
Let's just say it's a night-time drive.

00:17:37.570 --> 00:17:38.780
What?!

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:48.500
"Tochiman Inn"

00:17:38.780 --> 00:17:41.830
Now everyone, get in, get in.

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:43.830
And so the death drive commences!

00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:45.210
What're you saying, <i>zura</i>?!

00:17:45.210 --> 00:17:48.210
--Don't jinx us.
--Please scoot over a little.

00:17:48.210 --> 00:17:49.540
Hm? Where's Chika-<i>chan</i>.

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:50.840
She went to get a jacket.

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:53.050
Sorry!

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:54.210
Thanks for waiting!

00:17:54.210 --> 00:17:56.470
Too late!

00:17:56.470 --> 00:17:57.840
Are you ready?

00:17:57.840 --> 00:18:00.010
--What?!
--Mari-<i>chan</i>?!

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:02.350
She'll need to drive when she goes abroad,

00:18:02.350 --> 00:18:04.850
so she got her license after her birthday.

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:07.900
I'm now quite used to driving,
so don't worry, okay?

00:18:07.900 --> 00:18:09.940
So where are we going for real?

00:18:09.940 --> 00:18:12.190
Of course, we're going to find a star.

00:18:12.190 --> 00:18:13.440
What?!

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:15.610
Let's go!

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:19.870
Are you okay?

00:18:19.870 --> 00:18:22.160
I-I'm all right.

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:28.290
At any rate, I never thought
the day would come that

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:30.830
I'd be sitting in the passenger seat
while Mari is driving...

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:32.920
That's my line.

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:35.670
I never thought that the day would come
that I'd drive with you sitting next to me...

00:18:35.670 --> 00:18:39.260
Well, I guess it's more comforting
than Dia driving.

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:43.180
Funny, I was about to say
the exact same thing about you.

00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:52.230
Wow... Look... I wonder if
those lights are from boats...

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:53.570
It's pretty.

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:55.650
This is kinda exciting, isn't it?

00:18:55.650 --> 00:18:58.610
Yeah. When I think about it,
this may be the first time

00:18:58.610 --> 00:19:02.910
that the nine of us have hung out
without having any specific plan like this.

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:05.870
That's why I wanted all of us to go together.

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:09.670
We were originally planning
for just the three of us to go, but...

00:19:09.670 --> 00:19:12.130
We decided that we wanted
all nine of us to go...

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:13.540
Yeah.

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:17.090
Ah! Stars!

00:19:17.090 --> 00:19:19.630
--Really?!
--What? Where?

00:19:19.630 --> 00:19:22.220
--Mari-<i>chan</i>!
--All right!

00:20:14.650 --> 00:20:18.900
"Nishi-Izu Scenic Mountain Highway"
"Toi Parking" "Elevation: 800m"

00:20:22.740 --> 00:20:25.530
It's raining...

00:20:25.530 --> 00:20:28.080
What wish were you going to make?

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:29.950
What else...

00:20:29.950 --> 00:20:32.830
May we be together forever?

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:35.540
When we're about to be separated?

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:39.210
That's exactly why.
That's why I'll make that wish...

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:44.260
So that we'll be together again
one day for sure.

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:47.890
But... I wonder if we can't...

00:20:47.890 --> 00:20:49.640
We will!

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:52.560
I have faith that we will
definitely be together again.

00:20:52.560 --> 00:20:54.440
Mari-<i>chan</i>, can I use that?!

00:20:54.440 --> 00:20:55.940
What?

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:06.740
Once this rain is done falling,
we'll be able to see the stars for sure.

00:21:06.740 --> 00:21:11.450
So let's hang out more and more
until it clears up.

00:21:19.290 --> 00:21:20.380
Guys...

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:24.930
If it doesn't clear up, I'll disown God!

00:21:38.650 --> 00:21:41.610
Wow...

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:45.400
Amazing... It really cleared up.

00:21:45.400 --> 00:21:46.950
Ah...!

00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:48.160
A fallen angel?

00:21:48.160 --> 00:21:50.080
It's a shooting star, <i>zura</i>.

00:21:50.080 --> 00:21:50.990
Ah! Another one!

00:21:50.990 --> 00:21:53.000
Ah! There's one here, too!

00:21:53.000 --> 00:21:55.250
The tears of little demons...

00:21:55.250 --> 00:21:57.710
They're shooting stars, <i>zura</i>.

00:21:57.710 --> 00:21:59.540
It's so pretty.

00:21:59.540 --> 00:22:01.590
Ah! Another one!

00:22:05.260 --> 00:22:07.890
Our shine...

00:22:07.890 --> 00:22:13.770
May we find our very own shine...

00:22:15.230 --> 00:22:18.100
<i>Try and be brave</i>

00:22:18.100 --> 00:22:20.650
<i>I know it's actually scary</i>

00:22:20.650 --> 00:22:26.650
<i>It's not like I was able</i>
<i>to</i> <i>do it from the start, either</i>

00:22:26.650 --> 00:22:29.490
<i>I messed up a lot</i>

00:22:29.490 --> 00:22:32.160
<i>I was really frustrated</i>

00:22:32.160 --> 00:22:37.710
<i>But</i> <i>that</i> <i>gave</i> <i>me</i> <i>strength,</i>
<i>so</i> <i>just</i> <i>don't</i> <i>give</i> <i>up</i>

00:22:37.710 --> 00:22:43.420
<i>Tears</i> <i>in</i> <i>your</i> <i>eyes</i>
<i>that</i> <i>want</i> <i>to</i> <i>try</i> <i>believing</i>

00:22:43.420 --> 00:22:47.680
<i>Say "bye-bye" to hesitation and tears</i>

00:22:47.680 --> 00:22:49.340
<i>Now, let's go!</i>

00:22:49.340 --> 00:22:54.520
<i>Let's chase them as</i> <i>many</i> <i>times</i>
<i>as it takes, don't lose</i>

00:22:54.520 --> 00:22:57.770
<i>Everyone fails sometimes</i>

00:22:57.770 --> 00:23:00.810
<i>But dreams won't fade, dreams won't fade</i>

00:23:00.810 --> 00:23:06.190
<i>Let's chase them as</i> <i>many</i> <i>times</i>
<i>as it takes, don't lose</i>

00:23:06.190 --> 00:23:14.240
<i>'Cause today is today, and once</i>
<i>you</i> <i>wake up, it'll be a new morning</i>

00:23:14.240 --> 00:23:22.250
<i>Oh, the sun's smiling down on you</i>

00:23:36.020 --> 00:23:40.780
Next Time! "Uranohoshi Girls' High School."

00:23:36.100 --> 00:23:41.450
"#11 'Uranohoshi Girls' High School'"
